  "question": {
    "text": "The point of intersection of the normals to the parabola $y^2=4 x$ at the ends of its latus rectum is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$(0,2)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(3,0)$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(0,3)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(2,0)$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that point of intersection of the normal to the parabola $y^2=4 a x$ at the ends of its latus rectum is $(3 a, 0)$\nHence required point of intersection $=(3,0)$"
  }
